  },
  "sourceLocator": {
    "chapter": "Magic Items",
    "section": "10.21",
    "heading": "Cursed Items",
    "lineStart": 14708,
    "lineEnd": 14712
  },
  "section": "10.21",
  "rulesText": "A magic item's description specifies whether it bears a curse. Most methods of identifying items, including the Identify spell, fail to reveal such a curse.\n\nAttunement to a cursed item can't be ended voluntarily unless the curse is broken first, such as with a Remove Curse spell."
}
